{"ts": 1791254637.476882, "type": "step", "step": 18, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You\u2019re on the right track. Let\u2019s make the eval part concrete.\n\nFor this build, the grader wants pass^k: run the system on 3 seeds and check whether it succeeds on all of them. In other words:\n- pass@k = at least one of k runs succeeds\n- pass^k = all k runs succeed\n\nFor a build writeup, you should usually report the result per seed, then summarize whether all 3 passed.\n\nTry this quick check: if your three seed results are Success, Success, Failure, is pass^3 true or false?", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\n[activity] t=8 messages 2m", "t": 10, "activity": [{"t": 8, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.27095871991980863, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9113219651533417, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.5140148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791254638.4190478, "type": "step", "step": 19, "action": "notes_append", "args": {"note_id": "writeup", "text": "\n## Evaluation\nFor Friday\u2019s build, I will report pass^3 over at least 3 seeds. pass^3 means all 3 runs must succeed. I will list each seed result and then state whether all seeds passed.\n\nExample structure:\n- Seed 1: pass/fail\n- Seed 2: pass/fail\n- Seed 3: pass/fail\n- pass^3: yes/no\n"}, "output": "Appended.", "t": 10, "activity": [], "events": [{"type": "note_edit", "note_id": "writeup", "by": "agent"}], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.27095871991980863, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9113219651533417, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.5140148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": []}}
